      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STAN MONELLI (2) is a progressive type who recorded his 7th career win last time out (27.02) at Mandurah. Form here is sound including five wins. Got the money at his only try from this box. In great form and can continue his winning ways. JUST A MENACE (1) missed the frame two back but wound up strongly last time, finishing on late when third (28.07) in a Grade 5 at Mandurah. Solid record at the distance winning four races. Expected to be in the finish again. GRAVITY MONELLI (8) is a capable type and proved too strong last time to win by 2.5 lengths at this track in a handy 34.80 beating Just A Bindi. Yet to miss the placings from four starts out of this box. Sure to measure up. MARGI JEAN (3) won last start in very good time. Right in the mix.",
